  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.2.0: Added AuthOptions with configurable required claims. Introduced CachingSigningKeyProvider decorator with cache preloading at startup. Extracted AuthorizationPolicyEvaluator for pure policy evaluation. Added Vault pre-validation and dependency guard in DI registration. Improved error handling with typed failure codes. Reduced log verbosity to avoid leaking sensitive data. Updated HoneyDrunk.Kernel to 0.4.0, HoneyDrunk.Vault to 0.2.0, and Microsoft.IdentityModel.JsonWebTokens to 8.15.0.",
